tools/pipeline/check_probe_wiring.py:228:    #  floor breach found on pass 2.  The other two use only 0x06, 0x02 and 0x04 at
tools/pipeline/check_probe_wiring.py:229:    #  offset 1 -- all three with WDCTL_4BIT clear -- so every offset-1 row they
tools/pipeline/check_probe_wiring.py:230:    #  carry sits in ONE bit-3 equivalence class, and a guard reading
tools/pipeline/check_probe_wiring.py:231:    #  `!(idata & WDCTL_4BIT)` escaped BOTH at 36/36 and declined.  That bit is
tools/pipeline/check_probe_wiring.py:232:    #  libata's steady-state ap->ctl, so a mask guard re-opens the defect at exactly
