tools/pipeline/check_probe_wiring.py:597:    #  run owes ONE instrument, so the driver copies the probe once and every cell
tools/pipeline/check_probe_wiring.py:598:    #  scores against that copy -- a driver that re-reads the live probe between
tools/pipeline/check_probe_wiring.py:599:    #  cells gives run 1 and run 2 different tools, which this project has measured
tools/pipeline/check_probe_wiring.py:600:    #  (a 39/40 against a table of /39).  It is EVIDENCE, deliberately run by no gate;
tools/pipeline/check_probe_wiring.py:601:    #  the shipping copy is regress/sgi_de_primop_probe.py and gate_arm.sh runs that.
