tools/pipeline/check_probe_wiring.py:730:    #  (b)) and a one-hex-digit bound relaxation (clause (d)) -- against the REPAIRED
tools/pipeline/check_probe_wiring.py:731:    #  34-row detector, which now scores them 30/34 and 33/34 where the 28-row version
