tools/pipeline/check_probe_wiring.py:758:    "artifacts/sgireunmapped/killtable_20260831/repin2/score500.py":
tools/pipeline/check_probe_wiring.py:759:        (CLASS_RESEARCH, "sgireunmapped #499 REPIN2 -- scores four candidate oracles against five variants.  It EXTRACTS lines 66-197 of the shipped probe rather than reimplementing them, so session()/printed()/Addr/store/load are the shipped ones BY CONSTRUCTION and fidelity is diff-checkable"),
