tools/pipeline/check_probe_wiring.py:1487:    ignored        = ["gate_offline.sh:153  $ACDIR/selftest_absorb.py", ...]
tools/pipeline/check_probe_wiring.py:1488:    """
tools/pipeline/check_probe_wiring.py:1489:    hits, ignored, missing = {}, [], []
tools/pipeline/check_probe_wiring.py:1490:    for script in scripts:
