tools/pipeline/check_probe_wiring.py:1493:            missing.append(script)
tools/pipeline/check_probe_wiring.py:1494:            continue
tools/pipeline/check_probe_wiring.py:1495:        lines = read(path).splitlines()
tools/pipeline/check_probe_wiring.py:1496:        #  One-level variable map, from this file only.  gate_hygiene really does write
