tools/pipeline/check_probe_wiring.py:1549:                    if d in HERE_DIRS:
tools/pipeline/check_probe_wiring.py:1550:                        hits.setdefault(b, []).append("%s:%d" % (script, no))
tools/pipeline/check_probe_wiring.py:1551:                    else:
tools/pipeline/check_probe_wiring.py:1552:                        #  #471: a NESTED invocation is keyed by its RELATIVE PATH, not
