1556:                        #  by hand still reported UNWIRED once the scan could see it.
1557:                        #
1558:                        #  Path keys are also what makes the re-key SAFE: two detectors
1559:                        #  sharing a basename in different directories stay distinct,
1560:                        #  where basename keys would mark BOTH gated when only one is.
