1570:#  STANDALONE WORDS ONLY.  The first draft used a plain substring and reported
1571:#  mips_fold_probe.py as self-labelled "witness" -- its summary line reads "the MIPS
1572:#  fold-witness COUNTERS", where the word names a counter, not the artefact.  That is the
