1652:#  KILLED run read as exit 0.  subprocess.run(...).returncode cannot make that mistake.
1653:#
1654:#  A CHECKER-SOURCE MUTANT THAT DOES NOT APPLY EXACTLY ONCE IS A FAULT, NEVER A PASS --
