The six split into two probes with enforceable verdicts and four WDC measurement harnesses. All four WDC harnesses can finish with exit status zero after reporting failures. Their coverage also differs: the main altoffset probe checks write state and queued data, the signature probe checks ATAPI reset state, and the 4-bit probe covers a control-value case the other two miss.
