The existing homes are clearer now: `gate_arm.sh` already supplies the CATS stub and Footbridge coverage, `gate_asan_sweep.sh` covers machine construction, and `gate_sh_rounding.sh` has the WDC section. The signature probe needs CD-ROM attachment semantics but no special disk contents. The add-to-input-buffer probe does require prepared media with known contents; its setup cost is substantially different.
